      "en": "When they had eaten up the grain which they had brought out of Egypt, their father said to them, “Go again, buy us a little more food.”",
      "ko": "그들이 애굽에서 가져온 곡식을 다 먹으매 그 아비가 그들에게 이르되 다시 가서 우리를 위하여 양식을 조금 사라",
      "source_text_hash": "1b8c7294c9d0eb3a0e00c7a5d994724fe8e9a42506cf158e425098ecc56ed7bb",
      "translation_text_hash": "b16d1eb5a3be0348130d5987e18422b7031fad5631454bc37e1c963273636613",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
