      "en": "for if we hadn’t delayed, surely we would have returned a second time by now.”",
      "ko": "우리가 지체하지 아니하였더면 벌써 두번 갔다 왔으리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "a638b77d1ec7dba31fbdfbc8bf9a63b5b6b4f4a0db3d6e3b2fe8a09a9d1d78fd",
      "translation_text_hash": "463f92ba57cf711a5835f856cbe9d7c8f9aeec8de688e12ce42c4678cccdce40",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
